<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (The automated textual transcriptions from the recorded interviews were manually reviewed, cleaned, and cross-checked against the audio files for accuracy. The analysis followed a thematic coding approach using an inductive-deductive matrix \(Coding Tree\) that linked participant IDs to specific keywords allowed for the extraction of objective consumer insights from subjective discourse. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
199 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (This framework allowed for the grouping of opinions per question, the identification of dominant trends, and the pinpointing of outlier perspectives. Through this matrix, benchmark comments were highlighted to best illustrate the empirical findings.  )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
200 0 obj
<<
