249 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 137 0 R
/E (This comparison demonstrates that young consumers do not view online betting as a harmless entertainment product, but as an addictive substance requiring direct state-level intervention. Suggestions varied from total prohibitions \(Participant 46\) and restricting broadcasts to late-night hours \(Participant 2\), to banning high-profile celebrity endorsements \(Participant 35\).)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
